==Battleground==
*1 [[Hackey]] spawns as the boss after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*2 [[St. Pigge the 2nd]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 40~46.67 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Pigeon de Sable]]s spawn after 36.67 seconds<sup>1,100f</sup>, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
*4 [[J.J. Jackrabbit]]s spawn after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>, delay 23.33~30 seconds<sup>700f~900f</sup>.

==Strategy==
The stage gives you a good amount of time to attack Hackey at the start of the stage. Basic anti-Red fodder can clear this stage, given they are able to fend off Jackrabbits.

